# Playwright MCP's scratch directory, plus the measurement rigs for plan 009
# that live in it. Regenerable, and they need a Playwright the project does not
# depend on, so they are notes rather than checks the repo can run.
.playwright-mcp/

# Working notes, deliberately untracked. It was tracked until 2026-07-30, so its
# history up to that point is still there: `git log -- handoff.md` reads it back.
# What stops is future versions being recorded, which is the trade being made.
# It was never in the published mirror either way, since the shipped set in
# "Shipping" enumerates its paths and this is not one of them.
handoff.md
